{"step_index":378,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:19:45Z","content":"# CodeDuel — 1v1 Real-Time Competitive Programming Platform\n\nThe full-stack application **CodeDuel** has been created under `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel`.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Key Modules & Architecture\n\n### 1. 1,000-Problem Curated DSA Bank (`CD-0001` to `CD-1000`)\n- **Distribution across all 16 major DSA patterns**: Arrays & Hashing (120), Graphs (120), DP (130), Trees & BST (100), Two Pointers & Sliding Window (80), Binary Search (70), Strings (70), Linked List (60), Stack (60), Greedy (60), Heap (50), Advanced DS (50), Backtracking (40), Bit Manipulation (40), Queue & Deque (30), Trie (20).\n- **Difficulty distribution**: **250 Easy, 550 Medium, 200 Hard**.\n- **Metadata**: Starter codes in **Java, Python, C++, JavaScript**, expected time and space complexities ($O(n)$, $O(1)$), constraints, formatted examples, and public + hidden test cases.\n- **Seeder**: Automatically seeds on startup via [`ProblemSeeder.java`](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/codeduel/backend/src/main/java/com/codeduel/seed/ProblemSeeder.java).\n\n### 2. Real-Time 1v1 Versus Arena (`/versus/:matchId`)\n- **Matchmaking**: Redis queue with expanding rating search ($\\pm 50 \\to \\pm 100 \\to \\pm 200 \\to \\pm 500$) and repetition-prevention problem selection.\n- **3-Column Battle Layout**:\n  - **Left**: Problem Statement with markdown description, constraints, and examples.\n  - **Center**: Monaco Code Editor (language selector, local draft recovery, keyboard shortcuts `Ctrl+Enter`) + Test Results Console.\n  - **Right**: Live Opponent Telemetry Card (🟢 Coding, 🟡 Running, 🔵 Submitted, 🟢 Accepted, 🔴 Wrong, ⚫ Disconnected with 30s grace timer) + Server Authoritative Timer.\n- **Synchronized Lifecycle**: `3... 2... 1... GO!` countdown overlay $\\to$ 15-minute duel timer $\\to$ Result modal with confetti fanfare and post-match deep analysis.\n\n### 3. Isolated Judging Sandbox & Scoring Engine\n- **Sandboxed Execution**: Subprocess runner supporting **Java, Python, C++, and JavaScript** with CPU, timeout (2000ms)\n<truncated 272 bytes>\nts) $\\to$ Efficiency (300 pts) $\\to$ Speed (100 pts).\n- **Complexity Analysis**: AST/token heuristics providing advisory expected vs estimated complexity and optimization tips.\n\n### 4. Elo Rating & Global Leaderboards\n- Standard Elo rating formulas with dynamic K-factors ($K=40, 32, 24, 16$).\n- Redis Sorted Set (`leaderboard:global`) for rank querying backed by permanent MySQL persistence.\n- Post-match performance radar, community percentiles (\"Better than 78.5% of submissions\"), and achievement unlocks.\n\n### 5. Practice Mode, Profile Analytics & Admin\n- **Practice Browser (`/practice`)**: Search and filter 1,000 questions by difficulty, topic, and solved status.\n- **Smart Recommendations**: Recommends targeted problems based on weak topic areas.\n- **User Analytics (`/profile`)**: Rating progression graphs, difficulty mastery progress, and achievement badges.\n- **Admin Dashboard (`/admin`)**: Question bank management, test case configuration, and user moderation.\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Verification & Build Status\n\n- **Backend (Maven / Java 17)**: `mvn test` $\\to$ **BUILD SUCCESS** (9/9 unit tests passed: Elo calculations, anti-jitter tolerance, score hierarchy, complexity heuristics).\n- **Frontend (Vite / React 18)**: `npm run build` $\\to$ **1714 modules transformed with 0 errors** into `dist/`.\n\n---\n\n## 📦 How to Run\n\n### Option 1: Docker Compose\n```bash\ncd C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\ndocker-compose up --build\n```\n- **Frontend UI**: `http://localhost:3000`\n- **Backend API & Swagger**: `http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html`\n\n### Option 2: Local Development\n1. **Backend**:\n   ```powershell\n   cd C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\backend\n   mvn spring-boot:run\n   ```\n2. **Frontend**:\n   ```powershell\n   cd C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\frontend\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n\n**Pre-seeded Demo Accounts**:\n- `anshu` / `password123` (Rating: 1542, Rank: #248)\n- `rahul` / `password123` (Rating: 1518, Rank: #265)\n- `admin` / `admin123` (Rating: 2100, Role: ROLE_ADMIN)","truncated_fields":["content"]}
